// ============================================================
// Readme of GridHighlighter
// ============================================================ 

// ============================================================
// Description
// ============================================================

This script manages visual feedback on the grid, including cursor hovering, pathfinding trails, and enemy perception areas.
It uses custom shaders and MaterialPropertyBlocks to draw dynamic outlines and fills for combat zones, interactables, and movement ranges, supporting the game's tactical readability.

// ============================================================
// Responsibilities
// ============================================================

- Highlights cells currently hovered by the mouse pointer.
- Calculates and visually represents the player's movement path based on available cells.
- Renders dynamic enemy perception areas and attack zones.
- Interfaces with shaders via MaterialPropertyBlocks for efficient batch updates.
- Updates the virtual perception cache for off-screen enemies to anticipate threats.

// ============================================================
// End of readme
// ============================================================  

